hway.'),('labels',[21],'<p>Provide explanatory labels for the pictures and diagrams in the stellar-life-cycle poster.</p>','Correctly identify depicted stages and explain relevant transitions. Labels must match the actual illustration, not merely list unrelated stage names.'),('references',[16],'<p>Provide at least three references, including at least one book, using the required diary format.</p>','At least three identifiable relevant sources, including a book; correct requested format. Do not invent references or claim to have read a source not consulted.')]
